Subject: [PATCH 44/45] Sim: the text generator (solosim_talk.cpp) - moods from
 memories and state, what to say from the sim's own facts (news, dangers,
 dungeon runs and loot, rares, grief, clashes, ambitions, friends and rivals),
 eleven race voices true to lore, personality shading, /yell and emotes, and
 an answer from the listener; for townsfolk and adventurers near you; .sim
 talk samples; generated names checked against hateful/crude words (existing
 ones renamed on load)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JU37XfnHTvru3VVz2sNN7z
